From: Salty <99386653+PjSalty@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 02:13:43 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] cache: add EF second level cache packages

Intent: bring EFCoreSecondLevelCacheInterceptor and its StackExchange.Redis
provider into the publish output so the provider can cache query results in
Valkey or Redis.
Drop when: upstream ships a second level cache of its own.
Ceiling: pinned at 5.3.11, the last line on StackExchange.Redis 2.x; 5.3.12+
requires Microsoft.Extensions 10.x and collides with the host 9.0.11 pins
(NU1605). Bump together with the server's EF line.
---
 Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql.csproj | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql.csproj b/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql.csproj
index a19f066..23f0e86 100644
--- a/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql.csproj
+++ b/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql.csproj
@@ -37,6 +37,15 @@
     </PackageReference>
   </ItemGroup>
 
+  <ItemGroup>
+    <!-- Second level cache: must reach the publish output, so no PrivateAssets.
+         Pinned at 5.3.11: the 5.3.12+ line moves StackExchange.Redis to 3.x,
+         which requires Microsoft.Extensions.* 10.x and collides with the
+         host-provided 9.0.11 pins (NU1605). Bump together with the EF line. -->
+    <PackageReference Include="EFCoreSecondLevelCacheInterceptor" Version="5.3.11" />
+    <PackageReference Include="EFCoreSecondLevelCacheInterceptor.StackExchange.Redis" Version="5.3.11" />
+  </ItemGroup>
+
   <ItemGroup>
     <PackageReference Include="SerilogAnalyzer" Version="0.15.0" PrivateAssets="All" />
     <PackageReference Include="StyleCop.Analyzers" Version="1.2.0-beta.556" PrivateAssets="All" />
